# AEGIS direct Python dependencies (AEGIS-228).
# Pinned exactly. Transitive dependencies are resolved into requirements.lock
# with hashes; this file lists only what AEGIS asks for directly.
#
# Any change here must be followed by:
#   python3 tools/probe_dependencies.py --write-evidence
#   bash scripts/lock_python.sh
