# Added at M2 slice 1 under the owner's `m2-columnar-dependencies` approval
# (configs/governance/policy.yaml, granted in PR #5):
#
#   pyarrow, duckdb  AEGIS-230's obligation, due this milestone: Parquet/Arrow
#                    round trips over the AEGIS-026 normalized futures schema,
#                    with DuckDB querying the same Parquet. Implemented in
#                    slice 5; pinned here because the milestone's dependency
#                    surface is settled once, at activation, rather than drifting
#                    slice by slice.
#
#   tzdata           AEGIS-013 names DST cases. zoneinfo otherwise reads the
#                    host's tz database, whose version differs between this
#                    machine and the ubuntu-24.04 runner -- so a DST test would
#                    be environment-sensitive, which is exactly what
#                    deterministic replay must exclude. Session calendars are
#                    committed as explicit UTC intervals; this pin is what makes
#                    *generating* those fixtures reproducible.
#
# tools/probe_dependencies.py confirmed wheels exist for all three on both
# Python 3.12 and 3.14 before this change; CI tests both, so an sdist-only
# release on either would break the matrix rather than fail quietly.
